%% WYVERN-E 3.0 — TVC control split across Pi 5 (high-level) and Teensy 4.0 (real-time hardware PWM)
flowchart TD
    subgraph PI[Raspberry Pi 5 — Linux, high-level]
      A[State machine: phase = stabilize / maneuver] --> B[Compute setpoint profile]
      B --> C[Stream arm + phase + setpoint over USB-serial @100 Hz]
      L[Log commanded vs actual gimbal, attitude, video] 
    end
    subgraph TE[Teensy 4.0 — bare-metal, deterministic 500 Hz]
      C --> D[Read gimbal BNO085 quaternion + rates]
      D --> E[PID: u = Kp*e + Ki integral e + Kd e-dot]
      E --> F[Clamp to plus/minus 5 deg gimbal limit]
      F --> G{TVC system}
      G -->|A solenoid| H[FlexPWM hardware PWM -> 3x IRF520 -> 50N solenoids]
      G -->|B servo| I[PWM -> PCA9685 / direct -> 3x DS3235 servos]
      H --> J[Telemetry: actual angle, current]
      I --> J
    end
    J -->|USB-serial| L
    J --> K{burnout?}
    K -->|no| D
    K -->|yes| M[Neutralize gimbal; Pi hands off to recovery]
